/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 186 0 R
/E (Voice technology is becoming popular because people can speak instead of typing. However, most voice-typing tools are designed mainly for English and do not understand Indian languages or mixed Hindi-English speech very well. This is a big problem for Indian users because they often switch between Hindi and English while working on apps like Word, Excel. This creates an opportunity for a voice tool that is built specifically for how Indian people naturally speak and work)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
